--- Test 2: Equip/Unequip Item Conservation ---
Chosen Source-of-Truth Rule:
1. Equipping: handleSlotDrop deducts from character personal inventory first; if not found, deducts from shared party stockpile.
2. Unequipping/Swapping: removed gear returns exclusively to character personal inventory (member.addItem). Never duplicated into stockpile.
Walkthrough Note for the Record:
"Because removed gear always returns to personal inventory, any item equipped from the stockpile migrates into that character's bag when it's unequipped, and adds to their carried weight."

